OL,3,GNEWSAMan charged with murder after
OL,4,Aseafront stabbing
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been charged with murder
OL,7,Fafter a person died in hospital
OL,8,Ffollowing a stabbing in the early hours
OL,9,Fof Sunday morning.
OL,11,FKent Police said it was called to
OL,12,Freports of a man with a knife near the
OL,13,Fharbour area in Ramsgate at 04:47 BST
OL,14,Fon 23 August.
OL,16,FThe force attended Harbour Street and
OL,17,FHarbour Parade, where two men had been
OL,18,Finjured. Both were taken to hospital,
OL,19,Fwhere 52-year-old Ashley Jones later
OL,20,Fdied.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
