OL,3,GNEWSAMan charged with murder after
OL,4,Aseafront stabbing
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice confirmed that Kieran O'Rourke,
OL,7,F21 and of Seafield Mews, Ramsgate, has
OL,8,Fbeen charged with murder, causing
OL,9,Fgrievous bodily harm with intent,
OL,10,Fattempted murder and possession of a
OL,11,Fbladed article in a public place.
